++++++++## Requirements
++++++++- `sample_pkg` gains `mean(values)`, returning the arithmetic mean of a sequence of numbers
++++++++  as a `float` (e.g. `mean([1, 2, 3, 4]) == 2.5`) (intent Proposed outcome).
